# NOTE: these ARE committed on purpose, so a teammate can clone and run immediately:
#   backend/models/model.onnx + labels.json + scaler.json   (1.5 MB trained recognizer)
#   frontend/dist/                                          (built UI, so run.bat needs no npm)
#   frontend/public/mediapipe/wasm/                         (offline MediaPipe runtime)
#   ml_pipeline/data/**/*.npy                               (the recorded ISL dataset, ~10 MB)
